@startuml
title SSD - UC-02 / UC-03 - Pause and Resume Session

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "FocusDesktop System" as System

Learner -> System : pauseSession(sessionId)
System --> Learner : sessionPaused(remainingSeconds, pausedAt)

Learner -> System : resumeSession(sessionId)
System --> Learner : sessionResumed(remainingSeconds, resumedAt)
System --> Learner : timerSnapshot(state, intervalType, remainingSeconds)

note right of System
  Pause and resume affect the same interval.
  Remaining time is preserved across the pause.
  The backend persists remainingSeconds and pausedAt.
end note

@enduml
